	(text "Channel n: heater between HTRn+ and HTRn- (J11/J12, J13/J14).\nLow side QN switches at the PWM (D11, D10; 490 Hz analogWrite).\nHigh side QP is on only while CUT is pulled low (E_STOP AND HTR_EN):\nVgs = -VHTR x 10k / 13.3k = -9.0 V at 12 V. B340A freewheel for inductive loads."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 208.28 88.9 0)
